<title>USA: ECC declines comment on stock activity.</title>
<headline>ECC declines comment on stock activity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said ECC International Corp declined to comment on its stock's recent unusual market activity.</p>
<p>The company said its policy is not to comment on market activity or rumors.</p>
<p>ECC's stock was up 1-1/4 at 8-7/8 in mid-afternoon dealings Friday.</p>
</text>
